00:10:19,460 --> 00:10:21,440
But there should be something.

142
00:10:22,520 --> 00:10:23,960
Toolbar and tooltip.

143
00:10:25,460 --> 00:10:26,300
Next one.

144
00:10:27,390 --> 00:10:30,450
List view and grid view.

145
00:10:30,450 --> 00:10:36,900
So this is about how we see a lot of elements, right.

146
00:10:36,900 --> 00:10:39,210
How they can be viewed.

147
00:10:39,210 --> 00:10:39,840
Right.

148
00:10:39,840 --> 00:10:43,500
So they can be viewed in a form of a list.

149
00:10:43,500 --> 00:10:49,950
This is a list view or they can be viewed in a form of a grid.

150
00:10:49,950 --> 00:10:54,360
I'm sure you've seen it right, because a lot of apps use it.

151
00:10:54,360 --> 00:10:57,180
So grid view this one.

152
00:10:57,210 --> 00:11:04,020
Grid view like a table and list view this one like a list.

153
00:11:04,950 --> 00:11:11,940
So this little icon would be for list and this little icon would be for grid.

154
00:11:12,810 --> 00:11:13,440
Okay.

155
00:11:13,440 --> 00:11:14,280
Let's move on.

156
00:11:21,830 --> 00:11:22,230
Okay.

157
00:11:22,490 --> 00:11:26,540
So here is the next third term and it's pagination.

158
00:11:27,080 --> 00:11:37,250
So when the content is like divided in a few pages, you will see numbers of those pages at the bottom,

159
00:11:37,250 --> 00:11:42,140
like here for example, and it's called pagination, right, numbers of those pages.

160
00:11:42,290 --> 00:11:48,380
So you can skip some pages, choose the page you want and things like that.

161
00:11:48,590 --> 00:11:50,600
The pagination at the bottom shows

162
00:11:50,600 --> 00:11:55,010
there are four pages while there are only three.

163
00:11:56,740 --> 00:12:05,680
An interesting word while you can use it, if you, well, when you describe something and it's not,

164
00:12:05,680 --> 00:12:07,460
it doesn't work the way it should.

165
00:12:07,480 --> 00:12:08,830
So you use it like

166
00:12:08,830 --> 00:12:10,210
but basically.

167
00:12:10,210 --> 00:12:10,720
Right.

168
00:12:10,720 --> 00:12:16,570
While. The next one and the next one.

169
00:12:17,770 --> 00:12:18,460
Image

170
00:12:18,460 --> 00:12:19,750
carousel.

171
00:12:19,780 --> 00:12:21,520
Image carousel.

172
00:12:21,970 --> 00:12:26,950
So, yes, I think you could see that on many websites.

