00:12:26,950 --> 00:12:29,440
This is from Airbnb, for example.

174
00:12:30,520 --> 00:12:37,000
So there is like a set of things, usually images and usually they are link to something so you can

175
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:38,710
click and go there.

176
00:12:40,190 --> 00:12:42,080
Well, here's an example.

177
00:12:42,500 --> 00:12:46,040
The images on carousel are overstretched.

178
00:12:46,040 --> 00:12:47,120
Overstretched.

179
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:48,770
So the size is wrong.

