00:12:48,800 --> 00:12:49,970
Doesn't seem right.

181
00:12:51,440 --> 00:12:57,910
The next one. OK, scrollbar. scrollbar is this thing.

182
00:12:57,920 --> 00:13:00,350
So this would be a

183
00:13:02,710 --> 00:13:07,900
vertical scroll bar, and this would be a horizontal scroll bar.

184
00:13:08,440 --> 00:13:10,270
That's how we call those things.

185
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:15,520
And the action of scrolling, scroll up, scroll down.

186
00:13:15,640 --> 00:13:16,930
That's how we call it.

187
00:13:17,650 --> 00:13:22,150
For example, the vertical scroll bar on the right is duplicated.

