00:13:29,640 --> 00:13:35,340
The next one, please don't confuse it with scrollbar because this is a slider.

191
00:13:35,340 --> 00:13:42,780
Slider is usually used to set some value, for example, with volume, right,

192
00:13:42,780 --> 00:13:47,970
we use sliders often. Or like here with some sound characteristics.

193
00:13:49,260 --> 00:13:54,090
The user is unable to drag the slider all the way to eight,

194
00:13:54,120 --> 00:13:56,310
it stops at seven.

195
00:13:57,240 --> 00:14:02,820
The user is unable to do something, so can't do something.

196
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:06,180
Also useful when you have to describe problems.

197
00:14:07,500 --> 00:14:08,850
