198
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:11,310
Move on.  Progress bar.

199
00:14:11,520 --> 00:14:12,750
Progress bar.

200
00:14:12,960 --> 00:14:19,670
So this is a kind of information about the progress of some process.

201
00:14:19,680 --> 00:14:20,370
Right. Here

202
00:14:20,370 --> 00:14:26,360
we have 82% complete or 100% complete and so on.

203
00:14:26,370 --> 00:14:30,390
Information about how something is progressing, right.

204
00:14:30,840 --> 00:14:39,720
When the progress bar advances to 100%, the status doesn't change to done and it should change to done,

205
00:14:39,720 --> 00:14:40,310
for example,

206
00:14:40,320 --> 00:14:41,400
right, and close.

207
00:14:42,580 --> 00:14:44,050
So this is progress bar.

208
00:14:44,710 --> 00:14:46,900
And what else do we have here?

209
00:14:46,930 --> 00:14:51,430
Burger menu. I like the name burger menu or hamburger menu.

210
00:14:52,510 --> 00:14:57,700
So this kind of menu with three lines called burger menu.

211
00:14:58,270 --> 00:15:03,940
