00:15:19,960 --> 00:15:27,580
Well, notifications, for example, notification means like this message that there is something new

216
00:15:27,580 --> 00:15:28,630
for users to see.

217
00:15:28,630 --> 00:15:30,520
Well, this is a notification, right.

218
00:15:30,520 --> 00:15:33,520
I have six notifications from Instagram.

219
00:15:34,240 --> 00:15:41,170
The user receives a new message notification even when there are no new messages.

