227
00:16:11,200 --> 00:16:14,890
The model window doesn't close after the action is chosen.

228
00:16:14,890 --> 00:16:20,710
So even if I click something, it doesn't close.

229
00:16:20,710 --> 00:16:22,170
The window doesn't close.

